lyrics_source_description = "You can select the desired lyrics source.

Genius: Provides high-quality lyrics, covers most songs, and updates lyrics the fastest. No time-synced lyrics, ever.

LRCLIB: The most open service providing time-synced lyrics. However, many songs lack lyrics.

Musixmatch: The service used by Spotify. Provides time-synced lyrics for many songs but requires a user token to use this source.";
lyrics_additional_info = "If Spotify+🗿 cannot find a song or process the lyrics, the message \"The lyrics for this song could not be loaded\" will be displayed. With Genius, some lyrics might be incorrect as the tweak searches for songs in a specific way. However, it works in most cases.";
